Package: harbour-passviewer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Depends: libqtcore4, libqtgui4, libqt4-network, libqt4-sql, libqt4-sql-sqlite, libqt4-dbus, libqt4-declarative, libqtm-location, libmeegotouchcore0, qt-components, libbz2-1.0, liblzma2, zlib1g
Section: user/office
Priority: optional
Description: Viewer for Passbook (.pkpass) files
 Shows the passes found below the home directory with their fields and
 barcode (QR, Aztec, PDF417, Code 128), highlights the ones close to their
 time or place, and fetches updates from the issuer.
 .
 The MeeGo Harmattan edition of Christof Buergi's Sailfish app: Qt 4.7 with
 com.nokia.meego instead of Silica.
Maemo-Display-Name: Pass Viewer
XB-Maemo-Icon-26:
@ICON@
